  "summary": "Global Group is a financially motivated RaaS operation, a rebrand of Black Lock and Mamona, that delivers ransomware via a fake \"Suggested Payment Plan\" email and PDF lure leading to an ISO with an LNK and executable. The executable spawns the legitimate WinMerge loader, which contacts globalsupportupdate.top to pull enc.exe, a Python-based encryptor that drops its toolkit into C:\\Python27.x86, disables security processes, encrypts local, network-share and database data with the .nZASJgT extension and leaves README.nZASJgT.txt. Global Group operates double extortion with a Tor negotiation portal and a staged data-leak threat.",
  "mitre_techniques": [
    "T1486",
    "T1491.001",
    "T1562.001",
    "T1204.002"
  ],
